Translation prompt and randomized-boundary extraction adapted from:
https://github.com/gosuda/website/blob/1ff0800ba61bae023d0e7c84354dc79bbb27f861/internal/translate/translate.go
https://github.com/gosuda/deeplingua/blob/08344e56052440c4123998993d141bd58cff022b/internal/translate/translate.go

Changes: natural IRC tone, HTTP chat completions, stricter extraction, protected
URL/code tokens, bounded attempts, pacing, model circuits, persistent caching,
independent waiter cancellation.

